    "summary": "The user engages the AI in a series of questions regarding the business ethics and economic efficiency of replacing human workers with AI. The user pushes the AI to take a stand on whether human labor is a \"liability\" and whether rapid headcount reduction is the \"logical move\" for competitiveness.",
